<title>USA: Prudential's head bond trader Kenney leaves firm.</title>
<headline>Prudential's head bond trader Kenney leaves firm.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>James Kenney, head government bond trader at Prudential Securities Inc., has left the firm effective Wednesday, according to Prudential.</p>
<p>Kenney, who had been at Prudential for 10 years, could not be reached for comment and company officials could not say the reason for Kenney's departure.</p>
<p>A replacement has not been named, according to Craig Coats, co-head of taxable fixed income.</p>
<p>-- Steven Scheer, 212-859-1867</p>
